cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "NitroAfrica modifications to eCLM"
version: "0.1.0-peer-review"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Modified version of eCLM developed for the NitroAfrica project.
  The code separates reduced and oxidised atmospheric nitrogen
  deposition, routes NHx and NOy to the corresponding soil mineral
  nitrogen pools, and adds process-based diagnostics for soil NO,
  N2O and NH3 emissions, including rainfall-pulse and canopy-reduction
  treatments.
